    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis exceptionally spacious two-bedroom apartment is set within an exclusive development of just 28 luxury residences, located in the prestigious Knightsbrook Golf Resort in the heart of the historic heritage town of Trim.\n\nFrom the moment you enter, the impressive four-storey atrium and grand entrance lobby, complete with a magnificent crystal chandelier, create a wonderful sense of space and understated luxury.\n\nThe apartment boasts a B-rated BER, reflecting its excellent energy efficiency and providing residents with enhanced comfort and potentially lower heating and running costs.\n\nIdeally positioned within the renowned Knightsbrook Golf Resort, the property is perfectly suited to those who appreciate peaceful surroundings and outdoor pursuits, while still being within a few minutes' walk of Trim town centre. Residents can enjoy easy access to a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs and local services. A regular bus service to Dublin also provides excellent transport connectivity.\n\nFinished and maintained to an exceptionally high standard throughout, the accommodation comprises:\n\nWelcoming entrance hall with cloak press\nExceptionally spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area\nTwo sets of double doors opening onto a generous wraparound patio area\nSeparate utility room\nHot press\nTwo spacious double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an ensuite\nWell-appointed main shower room\n\nThe development is accessed through electric security gates, with a separate pedestrian entrance providing secure keycode access. The apartment comes with two designated parking spaces and a private storage unit located within the secure underground car park. Additional visitor parking is also available.\n\nCombining generous proportions, high-quality finishes, excellent security and a highly desirable location, this is a rare opportunity to rent a superb luxury home in one of Trim's most sought-after developments.\n\n**Enquiries via the “Contact Agent” link/button ONLY.**"
      },
